First of all, Murdaw dishes out a lot of damage, and Ashlynn's offense is still behind the others; the best way to use Ashlynn against him is to have her help Sap away his Defense before acting as a secondary healer.  Furthermore, Ashlynn is far more fragile than the other characters, as you will soon realize when looking at her HP; it's important to boost her defenses as much as possible.  

Aside from that, Milly will be your primary healer in the upcoming fight against Murdaw; it is extremely valuable, therefore, to have her consistently go before him.  She will almost always be able to do exactly that with the Agility Ring on.

